      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eRound both numbers to the nearest thousand.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eIn 78873, the hundreds place digit is \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18085\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/ge.gif\"\u003e 5, so round up. In 4986, the hundreds place digit is also \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18086\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/ge.gif\"\u003e 5, so round up there too.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18087\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/approx.gif\"\u003e 79000 – 5000\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSubtract.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSubtract.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003d 74,000\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
